1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,600
- One more question...
- Yes, you must be present to win.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,200
(grunts)

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,430
(Zack:)Okay, I'm ready.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:08,300
I'm Zach, and I'm, uh...

5
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,770
(Zack:)Oh, crap, why is this so hard?

6
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,140
(Penny:)Oh, hey.

7
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:18,780
(Leonard:)Hi.
Yo, P-dog.

8
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:19,900
(Penny:)What's up?

9
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:21,180
(Bernadette:)We're here to kidnap you

10
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,750
(Bernadette:)for a girls' night out.

11
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:26,400
Parenthetical: the term "kidnap"
is being used playfully.

12
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,620
(Penny:)I kind of figured that.

13
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:31,360
(Amy:)Good. Now put this pillowcase
over your head.

14
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,460
(Sheldon:)No.

15
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,300
(Amy:)She used to be much more fun,

16
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:38,400
(Amy:)until Leonard punched her
in the heart.

17
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:41,240
(Bernadette:)We just thought you
might want to go out

18
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:43,370
(Bernadette:)and have a good time,
maybe go dancing.

19
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:45,910
(Penny:)Oh. Gee, thanks, but I'm
not really in the mood.

20
00:00:45,910 --> 00:00:47,980
(Amy:)You do understand
that it will distract you

21
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:49,780
(Amy:)from obsessing
over the rich variety

22
00:00:49,780 --> 00:00:51,180
(Amy:)of sweet loving
that your ex-boyfriend

23
00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:54,250
(Amy:)is currently receiving
from the fiery jewel of Mumbai.

24
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:56,720
(Penny:)Okay, look,

25
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,190
(Penny:)if I agree to go out
with you guys,

